high value chemicals (HVC):
acetylene;
ethylene;
propylene;
butadiene.
Aromatics:
mixed alkylbenzenes, mixed alkylnaphthalenes other than HS 2707 or 2902;
cyclohexane;
benzene;
toluene;
o-Xylene;
p-Xylene;
m-Xylene and mixed xylene isomers;
